cosmic-ext-halcyon (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release of Halcyon, desktop widgets and themes for COSMIC.
  * Include six starter looks, thirteen widget styles, and coordinated
    wallpapers, colors, windows, dock and panel appearance.
  * Package the Settings launcher, desktop widgets, controller, helpers,
    user service, artwork, and dependency license texts.

